{
    "word": "fearmongering",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "6d330553-20bf-3dcf-971d-d49d5896946e",
                "word": "fearmongering",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0c0727b9-4811-4d2e-8549-9394f765a828",
                        "entry_id": "6d330553-20bf-3dcf-971d-d49d5896946e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "fearmongerings"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "05a0c68d-e61b-373c-b0c0-e6a256a71764",
                        "entry_id": "6d330553-20bf-3dcf-971d-d49d5896946e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of spreading needless fear; exaggerating purported threats in order to incite fear."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "87cd6462-a237-4453-93f4-14ebe495724b",
                                "sense_id": "05a0c68d-e61b-373c-b0c0-e6a256a71764",
                                "text": "But the ongoing dip they describe is far more modest than people fearmongering about a T crisis make it out to be, and likely due to lifestyle factors like sedentariness and environmental pollutants messing with our bodies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c4387eb-077b-4a12-a42e-69633462aa8c",
                                "sense_id": "05a0c68d-e61b-373c-b0c0-e6a256a71764",
                                "text": "Recent polling shows it’s the second most important issue among Americans. But a big reason for that is the relentless, bad-faith fearmongering around the issue by the Republican party themselves, perhaps best summed up by the startling growth this year of the toxic phrase ‘migrant crime’."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e6bc00e7-ad40-4307-b01e-10d8cf6ac66f",
                        "source_entry_id": "6d330553-20bf-3dcf-971d-d49d5896946e",
                        "source_sense_id": "05a0c68d-e61b-373c-b0c0-e6a256a71764",
                        "source_sense_description": "spreading needless fear",
                        "target_lang_word": "alarmisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "alarmisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3548ccd-e072-364e-8bb5-d98de96377b0",
                                        "entry_id": "5d348887-e982-3b9e-a235-6e10b2cb5d5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Production inutile de bruits alarmants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e041845-46ea-478f-ab5a-663862e6bdae",
                                                "sense_id": "e3548ccd-e072-364e-8bb5-d98de96377b0",
                                                "text": "On a reproché à Jacquard son alarmisme écologique. On l'a accusé de déprécier la science en insistant indument sur ses limites."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "740f9257-c555-4e43-99d3-6c3a01bf3a0b",
                        "source_entry_id": "6d330553-20bf-3dcf-971d-d49d5896946e",
                        "source_sense_id": "05a0c68d-e61b-373c-b0c0-e6a256a71764",
                        "source_sense_description": "spreading needless fear",
                        "target_lang_word": "Panikmache",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Panikmache",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "179c496e-e027-32c0-8fde-98ff2cb37db7",
                                        "entry_id": "3e193afe-7d55-3592-a57e-febb42d1ba2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Versuch, künstlich Panik zu verursachen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4bbba59-1394-4e93-8aea-dcf99650e7c2",
                                                "sense_id": "179c496e-e027-32c0-8fde-98ff2cb37db7",
                                                "text": "„Ich bin eigentlich sehr anfällig für jegliche Panikmache, aber es gibt so strenge Auflagen im Strahlenschutz - würde man wirklich Mikrowellen verkaufen, seit Jahrzehnten, wenn von den Geräten eine ernsthafte Gefahr ausginge?“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c19d8736-6aa4-4ca2-a86e-9f8c3242abfa",
                                                "sense_id": "179c496e-e027-32c0-8fde-98ff2cb37db7",
                                                "text": "„Das rechte Phantasma gesellschaftlichen Zusammenlebens basiert auf der Angst vor der Fragmentierung, auf der Panik und Panikmache vor einer Desintegration der Gesellschaft. Schon historisch führt diese Panikmache in die Irre.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab0aee84-a7e1-42d1-b42e-4b2aeeac10da",
                                                "sense_id": "179c496e-e027-32c0-8fde-98ff2cb37db7",
                                                "text": "„Vielleicht ist also doch nur alles Panikmache, und wir stehen gar nicht kurz vor der Apokalypse.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6d14ef9e-7226-42d0-a198-aa474b6031e2",
